data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"The user wants me to generate a title for a conversation. The user message is a directive about reading campaign context files and following input d001, then replying with a summary. I need to create a brief title ≤50 characters, same language (English), grammatically correct, no tool names, focus on main topic/question.\n\nKey elements: cs-campaign, member.json, input d001.md, dispatch ID d001, follow instructions, reply with summary.\n\nPossible titles:\n- \"cs-campaign d001 task execution\"\n- \"Follow cs-campaign dispatch d001\"\n- \"Execute d001 campaign task\"\n- \"Campaign task d001 with context\"\n- \"Process cs-campaign input d001\"\n\nNeed to keep it natural. \"Follow cs-campaign dispatch d001\" is good. Or \"Execute cs-campaign task d001\". Let's check character count:\n\"Follow cs-campaign dispatch d001\" = 30 chars. Good.\n\"Execute cs-campaign task d001\" = 29 chars. Good.\n\nThe user message is an instruction to read files and follow a dispatch. The main topic is the campaign task d001. I'll go with \"Execute cs-campaign task d001\" or \"Process cs-campaign dispatch d001\".\n\nActually \"cs-campaign d001 task\" is shorter but maybe too terse. \"Process cs-campaign dispatch d001\" reads naturally.\n\nLet me pick \"Process cs-campaign dispatch d001\"."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789958798,"id":"chatcmpl-3a42df8e19374e41adffb0d35722dca7","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

